            "text": "A clipboard history manager for Windows, inspired by Win+V. It keeps the last *n* items you copied, lets you pin items so they stay separate from that history, and lets you paste items with keyboard shortcuts.",
            "html": "Version:0.9\r\nStartHTML:0000000105\r\nEndHTML:0000000707\r\nStartFragment:0000000141\r\nEndFragment:0000000671\r\n<html>\r\n<body>\r\n<!--StartFragment--><div style=\"color: #bbbebf;background-color: #121314;font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;font-weight: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 19px;white-space: pre;\"><div><span style=\"color: #bbbebf;\">A clipboard history manager for Windows, inspired by Win+V. It keeps the last </span><span style=\"color: #c9d1d9;font-style: italic;\">*n*</span><span style=\"color: #bbbebf;\"> items you copied, lets you pin items so they stay separate from that history, and lets you paste items with keyboard shortcuts.</span></div></div><!--EndFragment-->\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
